# Excluded from the Cloudflare Workers deploy.
#
# journey-of-a-gift.mp4 is 35 MB and Workers static assets are capped at 25 MiB
# per file. The video is uploaded to Supabase Storage instead and served from the
# hostname in MEDIA_BASE_URL. It stays in /public so local development needs no
# extra setup.
#
# Pages ignored this file and needed a post-build strip script; Workers honours
# it, which is why that script is gone. Verified, not assumed: with this in place
# /media/journey-of-a-gift.mp4 404s while /favicon.ico serves.
media/*
